  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "死亡推定時刻は､幅を広めに見積もって\r\n昨夜の21時半から23時の間のようですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "おそらくは即死……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340010,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……\r\n死因は背後から鈍器で殴られたこと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040080010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340020,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "だいぶ重たいもので殴られたみたい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340020"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00729",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ゴルフクラブやトロフィー……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "凶器になりそうなものは色々あるけれど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "血のついたものは見当たらないね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340060,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "転がってるゴルフクラブは、\r\nあの入れ物に立てられるのと同じ本数……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340070,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "欠けているものはないみたい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "犯人がこの現場に初めて来たのなら、\r\n部屋に何があるのかは予想できないのではないかと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "犯人は凶器を用意してきて、\r\nそのまま持ち帰ったと考えるのが自然だろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00432",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──財布と身分証がある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0453",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……天井努\r\nこれが彼の本名か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340120,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうかした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340140,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "なんでもありません……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（幽谷霧子の様子も気になるが……\r\n他のところも見てみようかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "fg": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "散らかされたものに目が行くけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340150"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "壁のCDとかレコードはなんなんだろうね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340160"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "『Ａ』は犯人にかまをかけて\r\n『うたわせる』ことが得意だったみたいー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ですよねー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "ええ。田中さんの仰るとおりです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "うたわせる……自分の口で犯行を自白させた方が、\r\n犯人は言い逃れできなくなる……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "『Ａ』はそう言っていました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "へぇ。じゃあこれには、『Ａ』がうたわせた犯人の\r\n音声データが入ってるかもしれないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340190"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340200"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………んー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040050050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "どうかされたんですか？\r\n裏側をのぞき込んだりして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00733",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "se": "0353",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……レコードやCDを留めてる金具を登って\r\n天窓から脱出できないかって思ったんですケド",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340230,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それをやったとしたら\r\nレコードやCDが外れちゃいますよねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "もし登れたとしても、\r\nそこから天窓を閉めるのは難しいかもしれません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00531",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "天窓の開閉は、\r\n今デスクの上に載っているリモコンで行うので……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ワンチャン、リモコン持って外に出た後ボタンを押して、\r\n天窓が閉まりきるまでに放り込むのは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "だいぶ高さがあるので……\r\nリモコンが壊れてしまうかと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、だよねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340250"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そもそも落としただけじゃ\r\n綺麗に『置かれた』感じにはならないもんなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340260"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "fg": "off"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0200",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "クローゼットん中の金庫……\r\n鍵ばこじ開けられたりはしとらんみたいやね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340270"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "中身は綺麗になくなっとる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340280"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "解毒剤も、事件の真相を綴じたファイルも、\r\n犯人が持っていったんやろね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あと、クローゼットのそばに落ちとった鞄と\r\nデスクの引き出しが気になるばい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340300"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "お弟子さん、見てみんね\r\nいろいろ引っかき回した跡があるばい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "本当ですね\r\n犯人は何を探していたんでしょう……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0781",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 5000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……あと、これ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00432",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん、そん机……\r\n一番下の引き出しん中、色んな毒が入っとったばい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340320"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340330,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "昨日の夕食に混ぜた毒は、\r\nきっと『Ａ』がブレンドしたもんなんやろね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "毒の種類を特定して、解毒剤がなくても\r\nなんとかなるように動くのは無理そうですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも、お弟子さん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340340"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今回のは、解毒剤ば自分だけこっそり飲んで、\r\nあとは割るような犯人じゃなか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340350"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340360,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "自分以外の２５人ば殺すとに、\r\nためらいがあった人ばい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340360"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340370,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103234/4901032340370"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00690",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032340380,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちは探偵のみんなと協力して犯人ば見つけ出して、\r\n生き残る気まんまんばい！",
